{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"78bc9971805314997ff4566e48478a49f397d7d15fa573c9fb560ada92028478","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":303},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["凡從人間挑選的大祭司，是奉派替人辦理屬上帝的事，為要獻上禮物和贖罪祭",{"noteId":4},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他能體諒那愚蒙的和失迷的人，因為他自己也是被軟弱所困。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["故此，他理當為百姓和自己獻祭贖罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["這大祭司的尊榮，沒有人自取。惟要蒙上帝所召，像亞倫一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["如此，基督也不是自取榮耀作大祭司，乃是在乎向他說「你是我的兒子，我今日生你」的那一位；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["就如經上又有一處說：「你是照着麥基洗德的等次永遠為祭司。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["基督在肉體的時候，既大聲哀哭，流淚禱告，懇求那能救他免死的主，就因他的虔誠蒙了應允。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他雖然為兒子，還是因所受的苦難學了順從。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他既得以完全，就為凡順從他的人成了永遠得救的根源，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["並蒙上帝照着麥基洗德的等次稱他為大祭司。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["警戒叛道的人"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["論到麥基洗德，我們有好些話，並且難以解明，因為你們聽不進去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["看你們學習的工夫，本該作師傅，誰知還得有人將上帝聖言小學的開端另教導你們，並且成了那必須吃奶、不能吃乾糧的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡只能吃奶的都不熟練仁義的道理，因為他是嬰孩；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["惟獨長大成人的才能吃乾糧；他們的心竅習練得通達，就能分辨好歹了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：要為罪獻上禮物和祭物","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}